<urn:atm:triage:finding/BB6-003>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "BB6-003" ;
  triage:title "task_ledger_reader.rs's read_lane_error discards AtmErrorCode/cause instead of using the crate's existing read_lane_storage_error helper" ;
  triage:description "rust-best-practices-agent via BB6-QA-L1-1789263000 (PR #1458, feature/bb6-storage-prompt-handoffs @ a7d4664d1), verdict PASS 0/3/0, 2026-09-12T23:33:40Z. task_ledger_reader.rs's read_lane_error (line 207) maps every AtmError to ReadLaneError::Unavailable, discarding the underlying AtmErrorCode and cause, instead of using the crate's pre-existing read_lane_storage_error helper already used by sibling methods for exactly this mapping. The new prompt-handoff read path inherits the same helper's contract but doesn't call it. Independently verified by quality-mgr; ruled genuine by fenix." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-bb" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "correctness" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:source "rust-best-practices-agent via BB6-QA-L1-1789263000, ruled genuine by fenix" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
  triage:sweepScope "crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/task_ledger_reader.rs:207" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-12T23:34:12Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "Fix: replace the ad hoc AtmError -> ReadLaneError::Unavailable mapping at read_lane_error with a call to the crate's existing read_lane_storage_error helper, preserving AtmErrorCode/cause like sibling methods. Routed to solar on BB6-FIX-STORAGE-QA1-1789265000, branch fix/bb6-storage-qa1 cut from a7d4664d1, fence crates/atm-storage (+ rusqlite sibling). solar's BB6-FIX-STORAGE-QA1-1789265000 pushed fix/bb6-storage-qa1 @ 0c09c62b0, 2026-09-12T23:44:41Z; full gates running. Fixed-pending-QA. Solar's same-task follow-up (BB6-004 boundary fix: the seeded-double test moved into crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/tests/prompt_handoffs.rs, unrelated to this finding's substance) landed on the same branch at 35b733c09, 2026-09-12T23:58:56Z, self-reported lint 36/36 and just test exit 0. BB6-QA-STORAGE-FIX-1789267000 verdict PASS (PR #1459 comment, 2026-09-13T00:26:25Z): quality-mgr independently re-verified read_lane_storage_error used everywhere with the old local helper deleted, against the pinned diff 35b733c09 vs a7d4664d1, 5/5 reviewers agree. Closed." ;
  triage:foundIn triage:BB6 ;
